&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=5065881&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17040840" author="xtern" created="Thu, 20 Feb 2020 10:51:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I did 360 runs on TC with an extended timeout - no failures (see &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/7436/files&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;CHANGES&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewType.html?buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_Pds1&amp;amp;tab=buildTypeHistoryList&amp;amp;branch_IgniteTests24Java8=pull%2F7436%2Fhead&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;RESULTS&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;br/&gt;
Therefore, to fix failures, I increased the timeout to 10 minutes and applied a scale factor for the number of keys (to speed up regular execution).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
